# The second defining case: an answer, an attribution line, the quoted earlier message. The tail is REPLY_HISTORY, hidden.
subject: Re: Budget figures
sender: Bruno Lemaire
fold_from: 1
expect: 0 NEW_CONTENT show
expect: 1 REPLY_HISTORY hide
authored: Thanks, the figures look right to me. Send them to finance.
history: Here are the budget figures for the next quarter.
--- text
Thanks, the figures look right to me. Send them to finance.

On Friday, Alice wrote:
> Here are the budget figures for the next quarter.
> Tell me if anything looks off.
